  "description": "The Orleans.Lattice Explorer UI: a Razor class library for everything outside a Lattice App's frame - the navigation and session chrome, the shell-owned native areas (Data, Apps, Access, Schema, Tenancy, Replication, Backups, Telemetry and Cluster), the order-diagram design system in its Operate register, the credential-aware transport adapters, and the app frame host and bridge broker. Its static assets are served from _content/Orleans.Lattice.Explorer.UI. Nothing in it is an extension point: areas are compiled in, and the only third-party UI surface is a sandboxed Lattice App frame.",
  "id": "Orleans.Lattice.Explorer.UI",
